{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Times New Roman;}{\f1 Courier New;}}\paperw11907\paperh16840\margl1440\margr1440\margt1440\margb1440\f0\fs24 \pard\qc\b\fs36 Project Proposal for Bharat Innovates 2026\b0\fs24\par\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Project Title\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj \b Anusha Bazaar: Digital Quick-Commerce and Local Retail Enablement Platform\b0 \par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Submitted For\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj \b Bharat Innovates 2026\b0 \par\pard\qj Ministry of Education, Government of India\par\pard\qj Nice, France | 14-16 June 2026\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Applicant / Startup Details\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj \b Startup / Project Name:\b0  Anusha Bazaar\par\pard\qj \b Organisation:\b0  Anusha Technologies\par\pard\qj \b Website / App:\b0  \f1 https://app.anushatechnologies.com\f0 \par\pard\qj \b API Base URL:\b0  \f1 https://api.anushatechnologies.com\f0 \par\pard\qj \b Founder / Team Lead:\b0  [Add Name]\par\pard\qj \b Institution / Incubation Support:\b0  [Add Institution or Incubator]\par\pard\qj \b Email:\b0  [Add Email]\par\pard\qj \b Phone:\b0  [Add Phone Number]\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Sector Alignment\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar aligns primarily with the \b Agri & Food Technologies\b0  sector listed in the Bharat Innovates 2026 booklet. It also connects with \b Smart Cities and Mobility\b0  through location-aware delivery operations, route-based fulfillment, live tracking, and digital enablement for local merchants.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Executive Summary\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar is a full-stack quick-commerce and local retail platform designed to connect customers, stores, administrators, and delivery partners through one integrated digital system. The platform enables users to browse grocery and daily-need products, place orders, make secure payments, track deliveries, use coupons and referrals, and manage profiles, addresses, wallets, and order history.\par\par\pard\qj The project includes a customer mobile application, customer web experience, admin control panel, delivery partner application, and a Spring Boot backend. It uses Firebase authentication, JWT-based backend security, Razorpay payments, AWS RDS MySQL, AWS S3 storage, push notifications, WhatsApp campaign support, and CI/CD deployment through GitHub Actions, Amazon ECR, and EC2.\par\par\pard\qj For Bharat Innovates 2026, Anusha Bazaar can be positioned as a practical Indian digital commerce innovation that supports local retail digitisation, faster last-mile delivery, transparent order management, and scalable hyperlocal commerce infrastructure.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Problem Statement\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Small and medium local stores often face difficulty competing with large quick-commerce platforms because they lack integrated digital tools for product cataloguing, online ordering, real-time inventory visibility, delivery assignment, customer engagement, payments, and operational analytics.\par\par\pard\qj Customers expect fast delivery, transparent pricing, easy payment, order tracking, coupons, referrals, and reliable support. Delivery partners need a structured onboarding, KYC, approval, payout, and order execution system. Store and platform administrators need strong controls for products, banners, categories, coupons, customers, delivery partners, orders, notifications, and audit logs.\par\par\pard\qj Most existing local retail operations use disconnected tools such as phone calls, spreadsheets, manual billing, WhatsApp messages, and separate payment links. This increases errors, delays, customer dissatisfaction, and operational cost.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Proposed Solution\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar provides an integrated digital commerce platform for local grocery and daily essentials delivery. The system brings the entire commerce cycle into one platform:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer discovery, cart, checkout, online payment, wallet, coupons, referrals, and order tracking.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin operations for stores, products, categories, banners, discounts, customer management, orders, payouts, delivery partner verification, and live dashboards.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner onboarding with Firebase phone authentication, profile setup, bank details, document upload, admin approval, online status, available orders, pickup, location updates, delivery OTP, and payout tracking.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Backend APIs for secure authentication, role-based access, product management, cart, orders, payments, delivery, notifications, WhatsApp campaigns, and reporting.\par\par\pard\qj The platform is designed to be modular and scalable so it can support multiple stores, delivery zones, customer segments, and future AI-driven features such as smart search, demand prediction, delivery optimization, and personalised offers.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Innovation and Uniqueness\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar is not only a shopping app. It is an operational platform for hyperlocal commerce. Its innovation comes from combining customer experience, delivery operations, admin governance, digital payments, notification workflows, and partner onboarding into a single deployable ecosystem.\par\par\pard\qj Key innovation points:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b End-to-end local commerce stack:\b0  Customer app, delivery app, admin panel, website, and backend are developed as one coordinated system.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Firebase plus backend JWT authentication:\b0  Mobile OTP verification is handled by Firebase, while backend authorization is secured using JWT.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Delivery partner compliance workflow:\b0  KYC documents, bank details, vehicle details, approval status, onboarding progress, and locked-after-approval controls are supported.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Real-time delivery execution:\b0  Delivery partners can go online, accept orders, update location, mark arrival, confirm pickup, generate delivery OTP, and complete proof-of-delivery.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Admin governance:\b0  Super admin can create admins, set access codes, define time-limited access, assign modular permissions, and monitor activity.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Growth tools:\b0  Coupons, referral rewards, scratch cards, banners, marquee announcements, push notifications, WhatsApp campaigns, and customer engagement features are included.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \b Production-oriented architecture:\b0  Backend is configured for AWS RDS MySQL, AWS S3, Docker, GitHub Actions, Amazon ECR, and EC2 deployment.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Current Project Components\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 1. Customer Mobile Application\b0\par\par\pard\qj The customer app is built using Expo and React Native. It supports:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Firebase phone authentication.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Home, category, product, cart, checkout, order, and profile flows.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Address management and location selection.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Razorpay online payment support.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Coupons, referrals, wallet, wishlist, saved filters, and notifications.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Product images, banners, best seller sections, and responsive mobile UI.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 2. Admin Panel\b0\par\par\pard\qj The admin panel is built using React, TypeScript, Vite, Material UI, Redux Toolkit, Firebase, and Playwright tests. It supports:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin login and protected routes.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Products, categories, subcategories, banners, stores, and settings.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Orders, customers, delivery partners, payouts, and live operations.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Coupons, discounts, referrals, scratch cards, notifications, marquee messages, and WhatsApp campaigns.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Super admin controls, modular permissions, access codes, time-limited access, and audit logs.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 3. Delivery Partner Application\b0\par\par\pard\qj The delivery workflow supports:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Firebase phone OTP login and signup.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner profile, bank details, vehicle details, and KYC documents.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin approval status and onboarding status checks.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Online/offline status.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Available orders, accept order, arrival, pickup, delivery OTP, delivery confirmation, and location updates.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Payout tracking and order statistics.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 4. Backend System\b0\par\par\pard\qj The backend is a Java Spring Boot application using:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Java 17 and Spring Boot 3.4.2.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Spring Security and JWT.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Spring Data JPA with MySQL.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Firebase Admin SDK.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab AWS S3 integration.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Razorpay payment integration.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Twilio / WhatsApp campaign support.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Email service, push notification support, and app policy management.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab CI/CD pipeline with Docker, GitHub Actions, Amazon ECR, and EC2.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Technical Architecture\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20 Customer App / Website\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         | HTTPS + JWT\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         v\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20 Spring Boot Backend API\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |-- MySQL Database on AWS RDS\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |-- AWS S3 / Cloudinary for media and documents\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |-- Firebase Auth and FCM\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |-- Razorpay Payment Gateway\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |-- WhatsApp / Notification Services\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20         |\f0\fs24\par\pard\li360\f1\fs20 Admin Panel and Delivery Partner App\f0\fs24\par\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Key Features\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer signup and login using Firebase phone authentication.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Secure backend login using Firebase ID token and JWT issue.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Product browsing by store, category, subcategory, search, and filters.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Cart, checkout, COD / online payment, Razorpay verification, and order history.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Address management and location-based delivery support.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner onboarding, KYC upload, approval, and order execution.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery OTP and proof-of-delivery flow.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin order management, customer management, product management, and delivery monitoring.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Coupons, discounts, referrals, scratch cards, wallet, free item offers, and banners.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab WhatsApp campaign management and push notification support.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Role-based admin access, audit logs, access code verification, and permission control.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Target Beneficiaries\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Local grocery stores and small retailers seeking digital sales channels.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customers in towns and cities who need convenient local delivery.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partners seeking structured earning opportunities.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Local entrepreneurs and store operators who need admin tools for online commerce.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Regional communities where digitisation of commerce can improve service access and employment.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Market Relevance\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj India's quick-commerce and local retail digitisation market is growing rapidly, but many local stores remain outside structured digital commerce platforms. Anusha Bazaar targets this gap by giving local operators a practical platform for online ordering, digital payments, delivery management, and customer engagement.\par\par\pard\qj The solution is especially relevant for tier-2, tier-3, and semi-urban markets where trusted local shops already exist, but digital infrastructure is fragmented. By digitising store operations and delivery workflows, the platform can help smaller sellers participate in the modern commerce economy.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Social and Economic Impact\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar can create impact in the following ways:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Helps local stores reach digital customers without building their own apps.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Generates delivery partner earning opportunities.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Improves customer access to groceries and essentials.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Reduces manual order errors through structured digital workflows.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Promotes digital payments and transparent order records.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Builds operational data that can support better demand planning and local supply chains.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Scalability Plan\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj The platform can scale in phases:\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Phase 1: Local Launch\b0\par\par\pard\qj Deploy in one city or service zone with a limited number of stores, delivery partners, and product categories.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Phase 2: Multi-Store Expansion\b0\par\par\pard\qj Add more stores, sub-store support, delivery zones, product catalogues, marketing campaigns, and admin roles.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Phase 3: Regional Expansion\b0\par\par\pard\qj Expand to nearby towns with standardised onboarding, delivery workflows, payout systems, and localised offers.\par\par\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Phase 4: Intelligence Layer\b0\par\par\pard\qj Add AI-assisted smart search, product recommendations, demand forecasting, route optimization, fraud detection, and automated campaign targeting.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Competitive Advantage\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Built as a complete working software ecosystem, not just a prototype.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Covers customer, admin, delivery, backend, payment, notification, and deployment needs.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Designed for Indian phone authentication, Indian payments, and local delivery realities.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Supports operational governance through approval workflows, permissions, audit logs, and admin access restrictions.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Modular architecture enables future integration with AI, analytics, ERP, inventory systems, and logistics partners.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Implementation Status\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj The project folder shows active implementation across:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer mobile app: \f1 AnushaBazaar-U\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Customer web/frontend: \f1 Anushabazaar\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Admin panel: \f1 Anushabazaar_Admin_Panel\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner app: \f1 Anushadeliverypartnerapp\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Backend API: \f1 Backend_Original\f0 \par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab API handoff and documentation files for customer, admin, delivery, referrals, invoices, and authentication flows.\par\par\pard\qj The backend already includes controllers and services for authentication, products, categories, cart, orders, payments, delivery, tracking, wallet, banners, coupons, referrals, notifications, payouts, documents, stores, admin operations, and WhatsApp campaigns.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Roadmap\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\sb120\b Roadmap\par\pard\li180 Timeline \tab Milestone \tab Expected Outcome\par\pard\li180 Month 1 \tab Stabilise MVP and pilot operations \tab Customer ordering, admin operations, and delivery flow ready for live pilot\par\pard\li180 Month 2 \tab Local merchant onboarding \tab Add stores, products, delivery zones, and partner onboarding\par\pard\li180 Month 3 \tab Growth and retention features \tab Coupons, referrals, scratch cards, banners, notifications, and WhatsApp campaigns\par\pard\li180 Month 4 \tab Analytics dashboard \tab Sales, customer, order, delivery, and campaign analytics\par\pard\li180 Month 5 \tab AI-enabled improvements \tab Smart search, recommendations, demand prediction, route suggestions\par\pard\li180 Month 6 \tab Multi-location expansion \tab Repeatable rollout model for new service areas\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Expected Support from Bharat Innovates 2026\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Participation in Bharat Innovates 2026 can help Anusha Bazaar:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Present the platform to investors, industry leaders, universities, and research institutions.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Build collaborations for AI, logistics, retail digitisation, and smart city commerce.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Receive feedback from global innovation ecosystem stakeholders.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Explore partnerships with incubators, local commerce networks, and technology providers.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Position the project as a scalable Indian innovation for hyperlocal commerce and food-tech enablement.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Funding / Resource Requirement\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Indicative requirement: \b INR [Add Amount]\b0  for:\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Cloud infrastructure and security hardening.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab App store deployment, testing devices, and production monitoring.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Merchant onboarding and local operations.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Delivery partner onboarding and verification.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab AI features for recommendations, demand forecasting, and route optimisation.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab Marketing, customer acquisition, and support operations.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Conclusion\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\qj Anusha Bazaar is a practical, scalable, and India-focused digital commerce platform that strengthens local retail through technology. By combining customer ordering, merchant operations, delivery partner management, secure payments, admin governance, notifications, and cloud deployment, it addresses a real market need in hyperlocal grocery and essentials delivery.\par\par\pard\qj The project is well aligned with Bharat Innovates 2026 because it represents applied innovation from India's digital ecosystem, supports entrepreneurship, creates local economic opportunity, and has the potential to evolve into a larger smart commerce infrastructure for towns and cities.\par\par\pard\sb240\sa120\b\fs28 Annexure: Project Evidence from Repository\b0\fs24\par\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 Backend_Original\f0 : Spring Boot backend with REST APIs, security, payments, delivery, admin, and deployment configuration.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 AnushaBazaar-U\f0 : React Native / Expo customer mobile application.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 Anushabazaar_Admin_Panel\f0 : React TypeScript admin panel with operations modules.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 Anushadeliverypartnerapp\f0 : Delivery partner application folder.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 CUSTOMER_APP_API_HANDOFF.md\f0 : Customer app API documentation.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 DELIVERY_PARTNER_API_HANDOFF.md\f0 : Delivery partner API documentation.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 ADMIN_IMPLEMENTATION_DETAILS.txt\f0 : Admin and super admin workflow notes.\par\pard\li360\fi-180\tx360\qj \bullet\tab \f1 ADMIN_PANEL_API_DOCUMENTATION.txt\f0 : Admin API documentation.\par}